<p class="MsoNormal text-align-justify">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal text-align-justify">First, go to <em><strong>Thingspeak.com</strong></em> and signup with your mail, then click on channels. From there, click on the new channel to create the interface.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal text-align-justify"><img alt="ThingSpeak " data-entity-type="file" data-entity-uuid="415466e9-a658-40dc-98eb-45414ffbea67" src="/sites/default/files/inline-images/ThingSpeak_0.jpg" /></p>

