<p class="MsoNormal text-align-justify">Now, we need to display the data on the website. For that, click on the widget and select a widget. Here, we need to display the total weight and piece number (numeric) so select numeric display and click next. Now, we need to name the widget. Here, I am writing "total weight of the container". Now,&nbsp;select field 1(because we need to display the value of field one). Then select the unit and click create. Do the same for the second field.</p>

